<title>POLAND: BRE to lead PLN 20 mln credit group.</title>
<headline>BRE to lead PLN 20 mln credit group.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish Bank Rozwoju Exportu will lead a consortium including PBR, Bank Gdanski and WBK to lend engine maker  H. Cegielski Poznan SA 20 million zlotys, BRE said in a statement.</p>
<p>BRE said the funds would go towards boosting Cegielski's working capital. The firm specialises in producing ship engines and locomotives.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
